n tràn ngập mùi hương yêu thích.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLưu ý:\u003c/strong\u003e Chỉ được đổ tinh dầu vào nút cao su màu vàng, không được đổ tinh dầu trực tiếp vào nước.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/89/a9/5c/68e6dcb95a49a97a34669c2ec5a26a2a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"700\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/a5/b3/60/ef4b964f3fcddf19dd8032ae578e5382.jpg\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/27/fb/71/1c9b52a187c821621c1ecd04aa61773f.jpg\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/ef/14/17/5ed1f3fe366fccfd3cc3bda73bacf242.jpg\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/97/83/30/3f8289ca994cf9bdf08036a7dd1f2a59.jpg\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/08/47/ea/215b841f6165f7495c33839a5ef95f1f.jpg\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/f3/d1/77/0cf843a9eb34fc26b8d5c13bfea152c3.jpg\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/1c/9e/f6/a6992565487d10cb15fbbd956bee0945.jpg\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/1e/7a/9b/c4590e45ee7afe8f9e63bf037ec4186a.jpg\" alt=\"\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/fb/6d/9c/f6e7c3